@startuml
!include style.puml
top to bottom direction

rectangle "PROTECTED INTRANET" as Intranet #F4F8FB {
  rectangle "Researcher" as User #F1F7F3
  rectangle "Policy + RAG" as Retrieval #EEF5FA
  rectangle "Local LLM" as LLM #EEF5FA
  rectangle "MCP Tool Boundary\nread-only import" as Tool #FFF6E8
  rectangle "Release Gate" as Release #FFF6E8
}

rectangle "EXTERNAL" as External #FFF9EF {
  rectangle "External Application" as ExternalApp #FFF6E8
  rectangle "External Ledger" as Ledger #F5F5F5
}

User -right-> Retrieval : request
Retrieval -right-> LLM : evidence
LLM -down-> Tool : read request
Tool -right-> Release : release
Release -down-> ExternalApp : encrypted package
ExternalApp -right-> Ledger : hash + receipt
@enduml
